$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Uno Scandiam" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> 4:15 pm" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> got tired of not knowing what's going on outside their bases while inside. The Diamond Sword clan provided the soloution that was quickly copied by all the other minor clans. Clear flying bases are now the norm on Uno Scandiam, and are quickly dominating the sector.\nThese particular bases were designed by the Diamond Sword as tests, and incorporate some unique features. The 'Transmutating pill-Mortar box', and 'Belly turrets' are just a few inovations that have yet to catch on. \n\nEach team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touch it to their own flag to capture it.\nThe first team with 10 captures shall be the victor!\n\n<f1>               Map By ^^Plasmatic^^ \n               ziptiezmail@netscape.net";
         